# The steward-gateway commit the mock's schema comes from. scripts/schema-copy.sh fetches
# graphql/*.graphqls at that commit, assembles them into src/product/schema.graphql and writes
# the file's SHA-256 below. src/product/schema.test.ts checks, offline, that the committed file
# names this commit and matches the hash. Bump the ref, run the script, and commit both files
# together. Keep it on the same commit as steward-web's packages/api-client/schema-refs.env.
STEWARD_GATEWAY_REF=ffd0e7e4681f8765167b00f7acb8fde8a3e7f7c8
STEWARD_GATEWAY_SCHEMA_SHA256=8dcb18b554b0785600ce20d891851e738add0e8e626c3f3b5e86987f0ea27802
